{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "LTX VFX: Clean plate (IC-LoRA Clean-Plate 1.0)",
    "description": "Core ComfyUI nodes only (LTX-2.5 support in ComfyUI core). Distilled LTX-2.5 22B (int8), 8 fixed sigmas, euler_ancestral, cfg 1 (LTXVDualCFGGuider 1/1). IC-LoRA: LoraLoaderModelOnly -> GetICLoRAParameters -> LTXVAddGuide(source frames, frame_idx 0, strength 1) on an empty latent of the same size and length, stage 1 only at native resolution (reference downscale factor 1), LTXVCropGuides drops the guide frames before decoding. The source is trimmed from its start, resampled to 8n+1 frames (VideoFrameSample uniform) and centre-cropped to the target size (multiples of 32). The generated audio latent is discarded. Clean-Plate removes the people from a shot and leaves the empty background plate. No trigger word: the prompt describes the empty scene (model card template), not 'remove X'. Trained at 1024x576 / 576x1024, 49 frames at 25 fps; this pack samples at 25 fps, up to 97 frames. Source audio kept. LTX-2 Community License (ltx-2.x-community-license, gated on Hugging Face)."
  },
